        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Four, The Four II, The Four III\n- People: Woon Swee Oan\n- Topics: novel series, film adaptations, television adaptations, trilogy\n\nFacts:\n- Woon Swee Oan wrote the novel series \"Si Da Ming Bu\" (四大名捕; \"The Four Great Constables\").\n- \"The Four\" (2012) is the first film adaptation of Woon Swee Oan's novel series \"Si Da Ming Bu.\"\n- Woon Swee Oan's novel series \"Si Da Ming Bu\" had previously been adapted into a television series before \"The Four\" (2012).\n- \"The Four III\" is the final installment of a trilogy that follows \"The Four\" (2012) and \"The Four II\" (2013).\n- The trilogy that ends with \"The Four III\" is based on Woon Swee Oan's novel series.",
